{\n      \"text\": \"A 200 needs nothing.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"A 200 needs nothing\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 429 needs the stated wait.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"a 429 needs the stated wait\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 500 can be retried once that wait has passed.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"a 500 can be retried once that wait has passed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 503 means the platform itself is overloaded.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"a 503 means the platform itself is overloaded\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A caller that folds all four into one branch will retry hardest during exactly the incident the cap was installed to survive.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"A caller that folds all four into one branch will retry hardest during exactly the incident the cap was installed to survive\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"1000 is 50 times the default.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"which is 50 times the default\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The window, the header and the body are identical to the interactive case.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"The window, the header and the body are identical to the interactive case\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Nothing else about the batch tier differs from the default.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"Nothing else about the batch tier differs from the default\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused can't make a case for a larger cap.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused can't make a case for a larger cap\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The platform team won't assemble that case on its behalf.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"the platform team won't assemble that case on its behalf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three separate reasons.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three separate reasons\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Only one of them is a cap.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"only one of them is a cap\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Two of the three have nothing to do with how much traffic a caller has sent in the window it is currently in.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"Two of the three have nothing to do with how much traffic a caller has sent in the window it is currently in\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A credential can be suspended.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"A credential can be suspended\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A route can be closed while it is being repaired.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"a route can be closed while it is being repaired\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A request body over the 5 megabyte limit is refused before it has been read at all.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"a request body over the 5 megabyte limit is refused before it has been read at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A loop retrying against a suspended credential burns its whole budget.\",\n      \"line\": 31,\n      \"span\": \"A loop retrying against a suspended credential burns its whole budget\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A loop retrying against a suspended credential reaches nothing.\",\n      \"line\": 31,\n      \"span\": \"and reaches nothing\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The log afterwards shows a long run of refusals and no successes at all.\",\n      \"line\": 31,\n      \"span\": \"The log afterwards shows a long run of refusals and no successes at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The wasted budget is the caller's own.\",\n      \"line\": 31,\n      \"span\": \"the wasted budget is the caller's own\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually finds it doesn't need a larger cap in the first place.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually finds it doesn't need a larger cap in the first place\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A cap can be raised.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"A cap can be raised\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A cap cannot be raised but not on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"but not on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The team wants to know whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"The team wants to know whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests go to the platform team through the usual channel.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"Requests go to the platform team through the usual channel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"There is no expedited path.\",\n      \"line\": 37,\n      \"span\": \"There is no expedited path\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"An answer takes two working days.\",\n      \"line\": 37,\n      \"span\": \"An answer takes two working days\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Chasing an answer doesn't make it take fewer working days.\",\n      \"line\": 37,\n      \"span\": \"chasing it doesn't make it take fewer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":144885,"type":"result","duration_ms":157143,"uuid":"a17b8359-7e6c-4c22-ac2d-ac6eae68c052","ttft_stream_ms":1057,"time_to_request_ms":110,"first_content_frame_ms":1057,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
